{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：08:58 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<p>蘋果首款全新摺機 Apple iPhone Duo今日（23日）發售，首批預購客戶可於早上8時起取機。《星島頭條》記者今早未開門已抵達銅鑼灣希慎Apple Store，不少準機主已在門外排隊等候取機，惟人數比18 Pro開賣當日減少，排頭位的機主早上7時才到場。希慎門外的「收機黨」數量同樣大減，場面顯得冷清。有收機商透露，由於供應貨量少，前來取機數量亦較少。</p>\n<img alt=\"排隊人潮較18 pro時減少。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/3f47531528e1dda77515f25cb1432aa3/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_081515752_06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"排隊人潮較18 pro時減少。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/19fa502bfebaccdd57fe9d75d317745b/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_081515752_07.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/25c20bac971b6f13951ab0d1813c4531/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_081515752_08.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/0aaddd18e4ffa3c55bed44e9430f5263/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_081515752_09.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"希慎門外的「收機黨」數量同樣大減，場面顯得冷清。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1e7ebabb5ade0115e34ad81988293a25/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_083919960_04.jpg\"/>\n<p>有機主問價後稱，現場報價512GB白色回收價22,700元，即賺3,400元。趙先生認為未達到理想價錢，會轉至先達廣場放售，若水位不多，甚至會考慮自用。不過有手持「電訊商機」的盧先生則以2,500元水位放售其已開封的512GB手機，笑言「少少哋都照殺」。</p>\n<img alt=\"盧先生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4ad09fadedbed96644fdf7a49d1790d8/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_084025084.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"趙先生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/5ef816439e77474b1857bf422a138118/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_084056352.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘋果首款全新摺機 Apple iPhone Duo今日（23日）發售。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/730b2ec6fa47f64adcf43d5bf3a56d66/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_081515752.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/2a729b818dab4fdc8be17af92d980f9a/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_081515752_01.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/155133dffb877304d7b6a6ce0206d853/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_081515752_02.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/71341cf31a1a14b7d18e202fdd5a20ec/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_081515752_03.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6329d4d195b2650b2073f42514675dcb/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261023_081515752_04.jpg\"/>\n<p>記者：陳俊豪<br/>攝影：葉偉豪</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:57.987624+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:58:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.288258+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:34.614447+00:00","content_hash":"2924e1754a3676ea5a45c25c63da478f7ab6ef1ccaaf39166f36e6c34e43a154","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:57.987624+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}